OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FA crisp, dry morning with a     
OL,6,Ftouch of frost in rural areas. With    
OL,7,Ftemperatures slightly lower than on    
OL,8,FFriday, it will feel cold throughout   
OL,9,Fthe day, despite spells of autumn      
OL,10,Fsunshine. Some cloudy interval, mainly 
OL,11,Fduring the afternoon.                  
OL,13,CTonight:FPatches of cloud around but   
OL,14,Funder clear skies temperatures will    
OL,15,Ffall quickly to bring a cold evening,  
OL,16,Fthough slightly warmer than on Friday  
OL,17,Fnight with only a touch of frost.      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
