OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CSunday:FDry with some sunny spells in  
OL,6,Fthe north, but cloudier further south  
OL,7,Fbringing hazy sunshine. Feeling cold   
OL,8,Fin an easterly breeze.                 
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCalm  
OL,11,Fwith long periods of sunshine on       
OL,12,FMonday. On Tuesday, breezy with spells 
OL,13,Fof rain. Calmer on Wednesday but with  
OL,14,Ffurther intervals of rain and cloud.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
